# STD: Äänet

> Koottu vakiokirjaston luvuista (STD 3, 8 ja 9). Speksi on normatiivinen,
> joten muutos tehdään ensin speksiin.

namespace STD

component LISTENER
- last number default -1

sounds
- SOUND.STEP level 3
- SOUND.SNEAK level 1
- SOUND.FIGHT level 6
- SOUND.SHOT level 4

messages
- MESSAGE.SENSE.HEARD SOUND

```roguescript
on hear(who, s) as HEAR_MESSAGE priority -10 when who == player and (s.source == none or not sees(who, s.source)):
    if who has LISTENER and who.LISTENER.last == game.time:
        return
    if who has no LISTENER:
        add(who, LISTENER())
    who.LISTENER.last = game.time
    log(MESSAGE.SENSE.HEARD, SOUND: s.kind)
```
